# OpenRC sequential met data — US-Dk1 AmeriFlux (Duke Forest Open Field)
# 12 records sampled uniformly across the 0.5–6 m/s wind speed range.
# All records pass quality filters: sigma < 5 m/s, u* > 0.01 m/s, WS > 0.1 m/s.
# Stability class derived via Golder (1972) from measured Obukhov length (z=3.8 m).
# sigma_v and sigma_w are direct half-hourly eddy-covariance measurements.
# mixing_height_m is not measured at this site; left blank (config value used).
#
# Columns: stability_class, wind_speed_m_s, wind_dir_deg, u_star_m_s, mixing_height_m, sigma_v_m_s, sigma_w_m_s
